      "alt": "TQMLS1046A board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on the Arm® Quad Cortex®-A72 and the LS1046A NXP processor</h1>\n<p>The TQMLS1046A is an embedded Quad Cortex-A72 module, leveraging the power of the LS1046A processor from NXP. It boasts high-speed communication capabilities with 2x 10 Gbit Ethernet, 8x Gbit Ethernet, 3x PCIe, and 3x USB 3.0 interfaces, making it well-suited for data-intensive tasks in networking and industrial automation. This module offers up to 8 ARM Cortex-A53 cores for optimized performance and efficient power utilization. With DDR4 and ECC protection, it ensures reliable memory operation. Additionally, the TQMLS1046A supports an extended temperature range and incorporates security functions, making it a robust choice for embedded applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 11:03:19 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
